## Mission
Make the sub-four-minute hackathon video sell the real magnitude of HealthIA ONE through one continuous exact-head Cloud Run product journey — not a feature catalog.

## What changes
- shows a synthetic Health Connect event entering the real product before chat;
- visibly preserves authorized metrics, source and sensor truth boundaries;
- keeps the real Google Places mission, mission-scoped consent and deterministic choice;
- preserves original multimodal evidence before interpretation;
- shows the unified patient record and provenance-linked timeline after logout/login;
- closes on the exact-head unattended BP continuity proof;
- reframes the Charon narration around “one living system”;
- adds CUTLOCK markers for the new product-visible scenes;
- keeps the English judge timeline fully localized while preserving the Spanish contract.

## Safety and truth
- synthetic patient/device data only;
- Judge Mode remains read-only and credential-free;
- operational workers stay private;
- no autonomous diagnosis, prescribing or medication change;
- no claim that a synthetic device event is clinically verified.

