Exact-head video, full CI and visual QA are green. Independent final JUDGE is the remaining gate.

## Scope
Fix two Admin UX problems: long-running trademark replay tasks are currently a black box for hours, and Contacts overview/directory repeatedly execute expensive read queries on pages that change infrequently.

## Task progress
- add `MARKORBIT_ADMIN_PROGRESS_V1`, a read-only live progress endpoint at `/api/admin/v2/system/domain-progress`;
- show active Admin domain task, elapsed time, current package and corpus status every 3 seconds;
- for CN, infer durable phases from package + Stage checkpoint + final-publish checkpoint rather than inventing progress;
- expose raw parse evidence from completed internal source files/logical rows;
- expose final-publish durable ledger state and exact current native subtask: node/group, task index/total, range, attempt and success/running/failed counts;
- show a corpus percentage only for CN where the registered corpus is a stable denominator; US domains deliberately show package activity without a fake percentage because their source-plan items can be registered incrementally;
- preserve existing Operations V2/domain gates as mutation authority; the progress endpoint is read-only.

## Contact performance
- add a bounded process-local cache around Contacts overview, country list and paginated/filterable directory reads;
- TTL: overview/countries 10 minutes, directory pages 5 minutes;
- cache keys include every filter + limit/offset;
- add a cheap indexed successful-import generation fingerprint so imports from another process automatically invalidate stale cache entries;
- retain explicit `refresh=true` force-refresh for operators;
- expose cache hit/age metadata to the UI and add “重新计算/刷新数据” controls;
- add additive indexes for recent person→entity relation lookup, entity/profile evidence and successful-import generation lookup;
- schema/index setup is additive and does not touch CN/US source facts.

## Safety
No replay order, checkpoint, source-rank, lineage, Storage V2, memory-limit, release marker, legal inference or source-fact mutation semantics are changed.

